  "limitations": [
    "Six five-minute first periods per policy: seeds 9100-9102 with each physical team controlled.",
    "Small fixed-roster development cohort, not a 50-period held-out test or full-game win-rate estimate.",
    "Off means Classic skater control with the ROM CPU goalie, using the same manual-available save.",
    "Always requests goalie control in eligible defensive-zone situations; selective also checks skater usefulness and takeover/reach deadlines.",
    "Animations are confirmed ROM actions, not saved-shot or prevented-goal counts.",
    "Manual catch attribution excludes CPU offscreen assistance; clear_possession_ended is not a confirmed pass counter.",
    "Only fixture RNG, clock and starting side are set in benchmarks; gameplay handoffs use buttons, not forced goalie RAM."
  ],
